  {
    "id": "mcd-075-r-1sisc5l",
    "text": "Since Khao San road is mostly a nightlife destination this location opens super late in the day and has no breakfast.  For that reason alone I refuse to patronize this location and will never visit again. There's a 24 hr McDonald's with breakfast just up the road from Khao San road and in front of a major roundabout (circle).  Go there instead; the atmosphere is much nicer and it's a much bigger, brighter and modern McDonald's. By the way, McDonald's in Thailand is not super cheap like in Malaysia and Indonesia. McDonald's is significantly more expensive in  Thailand. A breakfast combo egg McMuffin with sausage and cheese, hash brown, small coffee, a second sausage egg McMuffin (not in combo) and a large coke cost three hundred and fifty baht. The sausage egg McMuffin with cheese alone is like one hundred baht (three USD!!!) without drink or hash brown.  Super expensive if compared to Indonesia and Malaysia!",
    "author": "Rob",
